## System

- **Host**: `your-hostname` (user: `your-username`)
- **GPUs**: N × GPU-model (VRAM GB each), topology notes
- **CUDA**: version (PyTorch); any nvcc version notes
- **GPU compute**: sm_XX — any capability notes
- **RAM**: NNN GB
- **Storage**: describe your storage locations; all configured as `[[locations]]` in `user_data/config.toml`
   - /path/to/fast/models/    Fast storage — active working set
   - /path/to/slow/models/    Slow / network storage — large library
